{#- The §C.3 unauthenticated row as a bare fragment (the fold-refute's
    F1): the session-less refusal pages render through the shell for a
    direct client, but an htmx request gets the row alone — the shell's
    responseHandling override (FOLD-2) would otherwise swap the full
    login page into the controls section on the ordinary expiry path.
    Same shape as failure-fragment.j2 without the operation fields
    (there is no operation — the session never authenticated). -#}
<section class="bw-failure" data-bw-failure="unauthenticated">
  <h2>unauthenticated</h2>
  {{ refusal_html }}
</section>
